This directory includes protocol framing and NIR pose decomposition logic
adapted from:

1. njmill/tobii-linux (https://github.com/njmill/tobii-linux)
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
   Specifically:
   - USB/TTP framing, XDS column tags (0x0500), in-band NIR frame tags (0x050e),
     and sync frame tags (0x1771) adapted from tools/app/tobii-ttp-mux.c.
   - CLAHE NIR preprocessing and forward-axis 6-DoF rotation decomposition
     adapted from scripts/runtime/mediapipe-face-worker.py.

2. Google MediaPipe Face Landmarker (https://ai.google.dev/edge/mediapipe)
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
